@startuml
title Smart Campus - Revised Domain Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
    - studentId: String
}

class Administrator {
    - adminId: String
    + blockRoom(room: Room): void
    + unblockRoom(room: Room): void
    + reviewUsage(start: DateTime, end: DateTime): void
}

class Room {
    - roomId: String
    - isBlocked: Boolean
    + isAvailable(start: DateTime, end: DateTime): Boolean
    + block(): void
    + unblock(): void
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId: String
    - startTime: DateTime
    - endTime: DateTime
    - status: BookingStatus
    + isValid(): Boolean
    + overlaps(other: Booking): Boolean
    + cancel(): void
}

enum BookingStatus {
    ACTIVE
    CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for

note right of Booking
R1: isValid() checks that the start is
in the future and duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.

R2: Active bookings for the same room
cannot overlap. Multiplicities alone
cannot represent this restriction.

R4: BookingService produces confirmation
only after a successful booking.
end note

note right of Room
R2: isAvailable() checks conflicts
with active bookings for this room.

R3: isAvailable() also checks isBlocked.
Blocked rooms reject new bookings.

Assumption: blocking a room does not
automatically cancel existing bookings.
end note

@enduml